      "en": "So Joab’s men[NOTE:1] came and laid siege against him in Abel of Beth Maacah. They prepared a siege ramp outside the city that stood against its outer rampart. As all of Joab’s soldiers were trying to break through[NOTE:2] the wall so that it would collapse,",
